  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-obbfile-uploadurl-0000001111685208#section992664711544",
      "text": "此接口用于获取文件所有分片的上传地址，调用此接口前必须先调用分片上传初始化接口完成分片初始化。接口调用者的角色：账号持有者、管理员、APP管理员、运营。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-obbfile-uploadurl-0000001111685208#section236517415165",
      "text": "本接口支持使用Service Account方式、API客户端方式和OAuth客户端方式，区别请参见使用入门。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-obbfile-uploadurl-0000001111685208#section236517415165",
      "text": "Service Account方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-obbfile-uploadurl-0000001111685208#section236517415165",
      "text": "API客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-obbfile-uploadurl-0000001111685208#section236517415165",
      "text": "OAuth客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-obbfile-uploadurl-0000001111685208#section15344132481910",
